window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>\"You said forever, baby. And I'm holding you to it.\"</i></b><br> <br> After a long tour of duty, Chief Warrant Officer Rick Spencer is finally home and ready to build a future and start a family with his fun-loving wife. Except Regan isn't quite herself anymore. Her heart is guarded, her defenses are high, and her attitude definitely needs adjustment.<br> <br> From the moment she learned he was coming home for good, Regan couldn't wait to be back in her husband's loving arms. Then she got the shock of a lifetime, and her world came crashing down around her. Rick has sacrificed far too much already, and she's not about to hold him back and watch him give up on his dream, no matter how badly she wants to keep him by her side. <br> <br> As Regan begins to pull away, Rick's new civilian job with Rossi Security places the couple in the crosshairs of a powerful drug lord. Extortion and senseless violence have Rick working overtime heading up his first investigation, but it seems the only way he can keep Regan safe from herself and the growing threat of the cartel is to give her a stern reminder that she's the dream he's never giving up, regardless of what comes their way.. <br> <br> Publisher's Note: <i>You Said Forever</i> is Book 2 in the Club Decadence series. It has been revised, re-edited, and re-covered. All the books in the series are steamy, suspense-filled romances that contain power exchange, BDSM themes, and scenes with graphic violence, which may be disturbing to some.</p>"; 
